<title>UK: TREG slams KEPIT delays.</title>
<headline>TREG slams KEPIT delays.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>TR European Growth Fund said on Thursday the Kleinwort European Privatisation Trust Plc's rejection of its improved offer would lead to increased costs for shareholders.</p>
<p>&quot;This whole process has been driven by the initial offer from TREG. The delays on behalf of the board will cost money,&quot; said James de Sausmarez of fund manager Henderson.</p>
<p>KEPIT has charged that TREG proposals would result in a fire sale of stock in the fund at the worst prices for investors.</p>
</text>
